<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="heading">学生学情与知识点</text><text>本页固定班级报告的同一快照；来源变化后须回班级报告重新选择，不混入新版本。</text><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">重新核对此快照</button><button bindtap="back" disabled="{{busy}}">返回当前班级报告</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}<button bindtap="login">核对身份</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{head && person}}"><button bindtap="trend" disabled="{{busy}}">查看这名学生的成绩趋势</button><view wx:if="{{taskTitle}}" class="card"><text class="heading">当前测评：{{taskTitle}}</text><text>知识点信号来自同一报告窗口。打开依据仅列出这次测评，未找到依据不表示零分。</text></view><view class="card"><text class="heading">{{person.name}} · {{head.subject}}</text><text>账号 {{person.account}} · {{head.className}} · {{head.book}}</text><text>快照第 {{head.snapshotGeneration}} 代 · {{person.calculated}}</text><text>窗口 {{head.from}} 至 {{head.to}}（不含结束）</text><text>有有效得分依据 {{person.assessed}} / 范围 {{person.targets}} 个知识点</text><text class="muted">“未测评”表示当前口径下暂无有效独立证据；已作答或练习不等于独立证据。</text><text class="notice">{{head.warning}}</text></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="heading">知识点证据比例</text><view wx:for="{{points}}" wx:key="id"><text class="strong">{{item.code}} · {{item.name}} · {{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.ratio}}（{{item.obtained}} / {{item.max}}）</text><text>独立题 {{item.independent}} 道 · 测评 {{item.assessments}} 次 · 最近依据 {{item.latest}}</text><text>尚未核验 {{item.unverified}} · 复练/练习 {{item.practice}} · 无效 {{item.invalid}} 道</text><text wx:if="{{item.ruleMissing}}">没有有效学科规则，不能据比例自行判定达标。</text><text wx:if="{{item.missingQuestions || item.missingAssessments || item.recentMissing}}">尚缺独立题 {{item.missingQuestions}} 道、测评 {{item.missingAssessments}} 次；{{item.recentMissing ? '缺少近期有效证据' : '近期证据条件未额外缺失'}}。</text><button bindtap="point" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查看纳入 / 排除依据</button></view><view class="pager"><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="points" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || offset === 0}}">上一页知识点</button><text>{{offset + points.length}} / {{total}}</text><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="points" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || offset + 20 >= total}}">下一页知识点</button></view></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="heading">测评与成绩状态</text><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id"><text class="strong">{{item.title}} · {{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.score}}</text><text>确认题数 {{item.confirmed}} / {{item.questions}} · 有效提交时刻 {{item.at}}</text></view><view class="pager"><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="tasks" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || taskOffset === 0}}">上一页测评</button><text>{{taskOffset + tasks.length}} / {{taskTotal}}</text><button bindtap="paginate" data-kind="tasks" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || taskOffset + 20 >= taskTotal}}">下一页测评</button></view></view>
  </block>
</view>
